Instead of hardcoding the logic inside the `switch` statement, you can store the dialogue data in a **Map** or a **List of Objects**. This makes it much easier to add new lines without changing the logic code.

**Pros:** Scalable, separates data from logic, easy to load from external files (JSON/XML) later.
**Cons:** Slightly more code to set up the data structure.

